- If valid and reset and accept condition? reset overrides, no sample.
- Trigger rise includes reset/invalid scans; previousTrigger updated to trigger at end. If trigger rise on a valid scan with cyclic false and reset true, not accepted. If next scan trigger true reset false, no rise. Correct.
- If cyclicExecution true but trigger false rising? no effect due cyclic. Previous trigger still tracked. P6 always.
- If cyclic false, trigger edge accepted exactly one. Good.

